Third-party components
----------------------
The artifact builds and redistributes the consensus clients and the official
Ethereum consensus specification below. These are NOT covered by Apache-2.0.
Each retains its own upstream license. The image fetches each at the pinned
version shown. The authoritative text is the LICENSE in each upstream repo.

  Component        Version   License            Upstream
  ---------------  --------  -----------------  -------------------------------------
  Lighthouse       v8.0.1    Apache-2.0         github.com/sigp/lighthouse
  Prysm            v7.0.0    GPL-3.0            github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm
  Teku             25.11.1   Apache-2.0         github.com/Consensys/teku
  Nimbus-eth2      v25.11.1  MIT OR Apache-2.0  github.com/status-im/nimbus-eth2
  Lodestar         1.36.0    Apache-2.0         github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar
  consensus-specs  v1.6.0    CC0-1.0           github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs

eth2spec is built from consensus-specs (v1.6.0, commit f96d3e7).

Prysm is GPL-3.0. The patches in modified_code/prysm/ are distributed under
GPL-3.0 and are included there in source form.
